On startup, retrieves a list of file systems that have the  mount
option  set.   The  list  is  updated every time a file system is
mounted or unmounted.  After a specified time passes, attempts to
unmount a file system, retrying after  some  time  if  necessary.
These  options  are available: Debug mode: increase verbosity and
do not daemonize.  Number of seconds to wait before trying to un‐
mount an expired file system after  a  previous  attempt  failed,
possibly  due  to  file  system being busy.  The default value is
600, or ten minutes.  Number of seconds to wait before trying  to
unmount a file system.  The default value is 600, or ten minutes.
